.TH MJVM 1 "2026-10-08" "mJVM V0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mjvm \- JVM-native M, drop-in CLI shaped like Reference Standard M (rsm)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mjvm
[\fB\-V\fR]
.br
.B mjvm
\fB\-h\fR
.br
.B mjvm
\fB\-i\fR [\fIdatabase-file\fR]
.br
.B mjvm
\fB\-v\fR \fIvolume-name\fR [\fB\-b\fR \fIblock-size\fR] [\fB\-s\fR \fIdatabase-size\fR] [\fB\-m\fR \fImap-size\fR] [\fB\-e\fR \fIenvironment-name\fR] [\fIdatabase-file\fR]
.br
.B mjvm
\fB\-j\fR \fImax-jobs\fR [\fB\-g\fR \fIglobal-buffers\fR] [\fB\-r\fR \fIroutine-buffers\fR] [\fIdatabase-file\fR]
.br
.B mjvm
[\fB\-e\fR \fIenvironment-name\fR] [\fB\-x\fR \fIM-commands\fR] [\fB\-R\fR] [\fIdatabase-file\fR]
.br
.B mjvm
\fB\-k\fR [\fIdatabase-file\fR]
.br
.B mjvm
[\fB\-\-class\fR] [\fB\-c\fR \fIM-commands\fR] [\fIfile.m\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mjvm
is the CLI for mJVM, a JVM-native full M implementation. The flag surface is a
drop-in subset of
.B rsm
(Reference Standard M): create a database volume, start an environment, run
M in direct mode or with
.BR \-x ,
and shut down with
.BR \-k .
.PP
mJVM compiles M (SET / WRITE / arith / DO / GOTO / devices / JOB / LOCK /
transactions) to JVM bytecode or an IR machine over the JvMumps
.B StoreApi
persistence SPI (memory or SQLite).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-V
Print a short version string.
.TP
.B \-h
Print the help menu (same sections as
.BR "rsm \-h" ).
.TP
.B \-i [\fIdatabase-file\fR]
Print environment information. If no database file is given, the path is
taken from
.B RSM_DBFILE
or
.BR MJVM_DBFILE .
.TP
.B \-v \fIvolume-name\fR
Create a database volume (1–32 alpha characters). Optional
.BR \-b ,
.BR \-s ,
.B \-m
set block size, initial size, and map size.
.TP
.B \-j \fImax-jobs\fR
Initialize and start the environment (prints
.IR "I AM READY." ).
.TP
.B \-x \fIM-commands\fR
Execute a string of M commands.
.TP
.B \-e \fIenvironment-name\fR
Initial UCI / environment name (default
.BR manager ).
.TP
.B \-R
Restricted mode.
.TP
.B \-k
Stop jobs and shut down the environment.
.TP
.B \-\-class
Compile to a
.B .class
(M2) and run, instead of the IR machine.
.TP
.B \-c \fIM-commands\fR
mJVM extension: run M source (same as
.BR \-x ).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B RSM_DBFILE
Default database file path (rsm-compatible).
.TP
.B MJVM_DBFILE
mJVM alias for
.BR RSM_DBFILE .
.TP
.B JAVA_HOME
JDK used by
.BR bin/mjvm .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I <database-file>.env
Volume metadata written by
.BR \-v .
.TP
.I bin/mjvm
Launcher script.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
mjvm \-v DEMO \-b 8 \-s 128 /tmp/demo.dat
mjvm \-j 4 /tmp/demo.dat
mjvm \-x 'S X=42 W X,! '
mjvm \-k /tmp/demo.dat
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rsm (1),
the JvMumps README under the same source tree.
.SH AUTHORS
mJVM is part of the JvMumps / mJVM project (RSM-equivalent full M on the JVM).
